uminlets":1,"numoutlets":1,"parameterEnable":0},{"id":"obj-11","maxclass":"newobj","text":"qlist","rect":[262,182,45,23],"patchingRect":[262,182,45,23],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":3,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-12","maxclass":"comment","text":"Auto-sequence Mode:","rect":[10,69,138,21],"patchingRect":[10,69,138,21],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-13","maxclass":"comment","text":"normal speed","rect":[13.5,104,91,40],"patchingRect":[13.5,104,91,40],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"bubble":1,"bubbleside":2},{"id":"obj-14","maxclass":"comment","text":"half as fast","rect":[108,104,75,40],"patchingRect":[108,104,75,40],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"bubble":1,"bubbleside":2},{"id":"obj-15","maxclass":"comment","text":"2x  speed","rect":[188,104,69,40],"patchingRect":[188,104,69,40],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"bubble":1,"bubbleside":2},{"id":"obj-16","maxclass":"comment","text":"rewind and trigger automatic playback","rect":[285,104,139,40],"patchingRect":[285,104,139,40],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"linecount":2,"bubble":1},{"id":"obj-18","maxclass":"comment","text":"Although qlist has no obligatory data format, it does contain a built-in automatic playback function which can be triggered with a bang. In this mode, if a line starts with a number or a list of numbers, the FIRST number is taken as a delay time in milliseconds. The number or list of numbers will immediately be sent out the left outlet, and the qlist will wait that amount of time before continuing. \n\nAfter the wait time, qlist will execute a remote send message if there is one on the same line, or just go to the next line. As with manual mode, all lines starting with symbols will be considered remote sends, and this will continue until it reaches a line that starts with a number or list of numbers, at which point it will send the number or list out the left outlet and wait the amount of time indicated by the first number – as before.","rect":[13.5,272,586,152],"patchingRect":[13.5,272,586,152],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"linecount":10},{"id":"obj-21","maxclass":"comment","text":"(Note that the last line of this example contains only a number - hence delaying the \"end of sequence\" bang out the right outlet.)","rect":[13.5,428,587,36],"patchingRect":[13.5,428,587,36],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"linecount":2}],"lines":[{"id":"pline-0","sourceId":"obj-11","sourceOutlet":1,"targetId":"obj-10","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-1","sourceId":"obj-11","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-6","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-2","sourceId":"obj-2","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-11","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-3","sourceId":"obj-3","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-11","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-4","sourceId":"obj-4","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-11","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-5","sourceId":"obj-5","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-11","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-6","sourceId":"obj-8","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-7","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-7","sourceId":"obj-9","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-11","targetInlet":0}],"stats":{"boxCount":19,"lineCount":8,"presentationBoxCount":0}},"\"remote messages\"":{"pageName":"\"remote messages\"","pageId":"remote-messages__obj-13","renderMode":"page-subpatcher","patcherRect":[0,26,625,494],"boxes":[{"id":"obj-17","maxclass":"comment","text":"move forward and send lines that start with symbols to named receive objects","rect":[64.5,92.5,250,40],"patchingRect":[64.5,92.5,250,40],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"linecount":2,"bubble":1},{"id":"obj-16","maxclass":"comment","text":"Remote Messages:","rect":[10,65,124,21],"patchingRect":[10,65,124,21],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-1","maxclass":"message","text":"next 1","rect":[95.5,145.5,47,23],"patchingRect":[95.5,145.5,47,23],"numinlets":2,"numoutlets":1,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-2","maxclass":"message","text":"fwd 2","rect":[342.5,145.5,43,23],"patchingRect":[342.5,145.5,43,23],"numinlets":2,"numoutlets":1,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-3","maxclass":"comment","text":"The “next” message advances the qlist. If a line starts with a number or a list of numbers, that number or list will be sent out the left outlet and then the qlist will pause. If there is a symbol after the number or list of numbers, followed by a message, this “remote send” will not execute yet.\n\nA subsequent “next” message will then either continue on the same line and send the message to the remote receive indicated by the symbol, or else will advance to the next line.\n\nIf a line starts with a symbol, the entire line is considered a remote send to the receive of that symbol name. The qlist will NOT pause, but automatically advance to the next line. This continues unabated until reaching a line that starts with a number or list of numbers, at which point the number or list is sent out the left outlet, and the qlist is again paused.\n\nWhen the end of the qlist is reached, you must send a “rewind” message in order to restart from the beginning with a new “next” message.","rect":[16,264,590,210],"patchingRect":[16,264,590,210],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13,"linecount":14},{"id":"obj-4","maxclass":"message","text":"rewind","rect":[34.5,145.5,50,23],"patchingRect":[34.5,145.5,50,23],"numinlets":2,"numoutlets":1,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-5","maxclass":"message","text":"next","rect":[20,101,36,23],"patchingRect":[20,101,36,23],"numinlets":2,"numoutlets":1,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"obj-6","maxclass":"newobj","text":"print direct-out","rect":[20,228,94,23],"patchingRect":[20,228,94,23],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":13},{"id":"o